        dct:title "A morphospace for reef fishes: elongation is the dominant axis of body shape evolution" .
    <https://doi.org/10.5061/dryad.fn457gr> dct:date "2019"^^xsd:gYear ;
        dct:title "Data from: The influence of size on body shape diversification across Indo-Pacific shore fishes" .
